  "description": [
    "128 pages : 23 cm",
    "\"What's so great about a copper skillet? Almost everything! Copper skillets are versatile, durable, nonstick and inexpensive and that's just the beginning. Fried chicken is a tried-and-true skillet classic, but you can use your skillet for so much more: searing, broiling, braising, sautéing, stir-frying, roasting and baking. Choose from more than 60 delicious recipes including pancakes, grilled cheese sandwiches, chicken parmesan, skillet cookies and so much more! With more than 50 inspiring photos of the finished dishes, you won't know which recipe to cook first.\" -- Amazon.com",
    "Spiral-bound",
    "Includes Metric conversion charts"
